#: scenario:scenario_CA7AF55F_919F_44AE_AA6F_B113BFB2D8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4432b3f191a744ac8d40a562f4db16c9dc6e476d8ab5814d0718ea5b72603861
