msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maids, by and large, were selected from the daughters of other esteemed families."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Служанки, по большей части, были дочерями из других знатных семей."

#: scenario:scenario_FA6A950A_915A_4A16_9051_F376D8BE7F12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
